<div style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,sans-serif;max-width:940px;margin:0 auto;padding:18px 20px;color:#1f2933;background:#fbfcfe;border:1px solid #e3e8ef;border-radius:14px;line-height:1.45;">
  <div style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.09em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7b8794;font-weight:700;">simplify-android-app · slice</div>
  <h3 style="margin:4px 0 2px;font-size:20px;color:#111827;">14-slice dependency DAG — gate → risky&nbsp;3 → cleanups</h3>
  <div style="font-size:13px;color:#52606d;margin-bottom:16px;">By code area, risky-3-first. A test net gates everything; four slices are independent and can run any time; docs land last.</div>

  <!-- LANE: GATE -->
  <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px;">
    <div style="flex:0 0 88px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.07em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0f766e;font-weight:700;text-align:right;">Gate</div>
    <div style="flex:1;display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
      <div style="background:#0f766e;color:#ecfdf5;border-radius:9px;padding:9px 12px;min-width:200px;">
        <div style="font-weight:700;font-size:14px;">1 · test-net <span style="font-weight:600;font-size:11px;opacity:.85;">· m</span></div>
        <div style="font-size:11px;opacity:.92;margin-top:2px;">E1 revive infra + Firestore characterization. <b>Best-first.</b> Hard prereq for the FTS fix &amp; the Firestore dedup/IO slices.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div style="margin-left:98px;color:#9aa5b1;font-size:16px;margin-bottom:4px;">↓ gates</div>

  <!-- LANE: RISKY 3 -->
  <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px;">
    <div style="flex:0 0 88px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.07em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#b91c1c;font-weight:700;text-align:right;padding-top:8px;">Risky&nbsp;3<br>+ scope</div>
    <div style="flex:1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(205px,1fr));gap:8px;">
      <div style="border:1px solid #fecaca;background:#fff5f5;border-radius:9px;padding:9px 11px;"><b style="color:#991b1b;">2 · fts-search-fix · s</b><div style="font-size:11.5px;color:#52606d;margin-top:2px;">A1 — sanitized query reaches DAO. Behaviour-change, own tests. ← test-net</div></div>
      <div style="border:1px solid #fecaca;background:#fff5f5;border-radius:9px;padding:9px 11px;"><b style="color:#991b1b;">3 · streaming-restore · l</b><div style="font-size:11.5px;color:#52606d;margin-top:2px;">A2+A2b — constant-memory pages, &gt;900KB rehydrate, drop deprecated method. ← test-net</div></div>
      <div style="border:1px solid #fecaca;background:#fff5f5;border-radius:9px;padding:9px 11px;"><b style="color:#991b1b;">4 · batched-tag-reads · m</b> <span style="font-size:10px;background:#991b1b;color:#fff;border-radius:4px;padding:1px 5px;">deploy-gate</span><div style="font-size:11.5px;color:#52606d;margin-top:2px;">A3 — sub-N+1 tags. collectionGroup⇒index+rules <i>or</i> whereIn≤30 (plan). ← test-net</div></div>
      <div style="border:1px solid #fde6c8;background:#fffaf0;border-radius:9px;padding:9px 11px;"><b style="color:#92600a;">5 · app-scope · s</b><div style="font-size:11.5px;color:#52606d;margin-top:2px;">A4 — @ApplicationScope SupervisorJob. <b>Foundational</b> for B1 &amp; B3. ← test-net</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div style="margin-left:98px;color:#9aa5b1;font-size:16px;margin-bottom:4px;">↓ then preserving cleanups</div>

  <!-- LANE: FIRESTORE CHAIN -->
  <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px;">
    <div style="flex:0 0 88px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.07em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1e40af;font-weight:700;text-align:right;">Firestore<br>chain</div>
    <div style="flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
      <div style="border:1px solid #dbe4f0;background:#f7faff;border-radius:9px;padding:9px 11px;min-width:185px;"><b style="color:#1e3a8a;">6 · firestore-dedup · l</b><div style="font-size:11.5px;color:#52606d;margin-top:2px;">B1 constants · guard · addArticleToBatch · applyRemoteArticles · tag-backup. ← test-net, app-scope</div></div>
      <div style="color:#9aa5b1;font-size:18px;">→</div>
      <div style="border:1px solid #dbe4f0;background:#f7faff;border-radius:9px;padding:9px 11px;min-width:185px;"><b style="color:#1e3a8a;">7 · firestore-io · m</b><div style="font-size:11.5px;color:#52606d;margin-top:2px;">B2 single meta-read · per-chunk batch · bulk tag-delete. ← firestore-dedup</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- LANE: REPO CHAIN -->
  <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px;">
    <div style="flex:0 0 88px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.07em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1e40af;font-weight:700;text-align:right;">Repo<br>chain</div>
    <div style="flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
      <div style="border:1px solid #dbe4f0;background:#f7faff;border-radius:9px;padding:9px 11px;min-width:185px;"><b style="color:#1e3a8a;">8 · article-repository · s</b><div style="font-size:11.5px;color:#52606d;margin-top:2px;">B3 inject Firebase in delete() · bulk add(). ← app-scope</div></div>
      <div style="color:#9aa5b1;font-size:18px;">→</div>
      <div style="border:1px solid #dbe4f0;background:#f7faff;border-radius:9px;padding:9px 11px;min-width:185px;"><b style="color:#1e3a8a;">10 · list-viewmodel · s</b><div style="font-size:11.5px;color:#52606d;margin-top:2px;">B5 dead code · all DAO→repo (broadened) · drop pass-through use case. ← article-repository</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- LANE: INDEPENDENT -->
  <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px;">
    <div style="flex:0 0 88px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.07em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5b6776;font-weight:700;text-align:right;padding-top:8px;">Independent<br>(parallel)</div>
    <div style="flex:1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(205px,1fr));gap:8px;">
      <div style="border:1px solid #e3e8ef;background:#fff;border-radius:9px;padding:9px 11px;"><b style="color:#3e4c59;">9 · detail-viewmodel · m</b><div style="font-size:11.5px;color:#52606d;margin-top:2px;">B4 nested combine (−9 casts) · typed key · @Singleton UrlModifier · ArchiveType enum.</div></div>
      <div style="border:1px solid #e3e8ef;background:#fff;border-radius:9px;padding:9px 11px;"><b style="color:#3e4c59;">11 · list-rendering · m</b><div style="font-size:11.5px;color:#52606d;margin-top:2px;">B6+B8 merged — kill dead gradient, remember() parse/tags, trace palette → decide allowHardware.</div></div>
      <div style="border:1px solid #e3e8ef;background:#fff;border-radius:9px;padding:9px 11px;"><b style="color:#3e4c59;">12 · sync-worker · m</b><div style="font-size:11.5px;color:#52606d;margin-top:2px;">B7 join() not poll · paginate load · drop dead method + getInstance().</div></div>
      <div style="border:1px solid #e3e8ef;background:#fff;border-radius:9px;padding:9px 11px;"><b style="color:#3e4c59;">13 · cross-cutting-url · s</b><div style="font-size:11.5px;color:#52606d;margin-top:2px;">B9 Article.computeNormalizedUrl() × 6 sites. ⚠ conflict-prone — sequence near neighbours.</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div style="margin-left:98px;color:#9aa5b1;font-size:16px;margin-bottom:4px;">↓ after the architecture settles</div>

  <!-- LANE: DOCS -->
  <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:6px;">
    <div style="flex:0 0 88px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.07em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6b21a8;font-weight:700;text-align:right;">Docs</div>
    <div style="flex:1;">
      <div style="border:1px solid #e9d5ff;background:#faf5ff;border-radius:9px;padding:9px 12px;min-width:200px;"><b style="color:#6b21a8;">14 · architecture-docs · m</b><div style="font-size:11.5px;color:#52606d;margin-top:2px;">Diátaxis: sync/backup architecture + app-scope/DI conventions (+ index/rules ref iff A3 deployed collectionGroup). ← dedup, io, restore, tags, scope</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top:14px;display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:12px;">
    <div style="flex:1 1 240px;background:#fff5f5;border:1px solid #fecaca;border-radius:9px;padding:9px 11px;"><b style="color:#991b1b;">⛔ Only deploy gate</b> — <span style="color:#52606d;">slice 4 (<code>batched-tag-reads</code>). If collectionGroup: index + rules on shared <code>trails-e428e</code> deployed &amp; verified live <i>before</i> code merges. Else client-only whereIn≤30.</span></div>
    <div style="flex:1 1 240px;background:#fffaf0;border:1px solid #f3d9a8;border-radius:9px;padding:9px 11px;"><b style="color:#92600a;">▶ Best-first</b> — <span style="color:#52606d;"><code>test-net</code>. The whole risky-3 + dedup chain is held to parity by its characterization suite, so it lands before any refactor.</span></div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top:12px;font-size:11px;color:#7b8794;">14 slices · only 4 behaviour-changing (2,3,4,5) · 1 deploy-gated · 4 independent · hard cutover · slug-wide review at handoff. Next: <code>/wf plan simplify-android-app test-net</code>.</div>
</div>
